# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and on checkout, for
# every platform. `.editorconfig` already says `end_of_line = lf`, but nothing
# enforced it: three files were committed with CRLF from a Windows editor, and
# a one-line edit to any of them from a Linux checkout rewrote the whole file
# in the diff — a six-line change reading as 244.
*         text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so Git must not touch them.
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.gif     binary
*.webp    binary
*.ico     binary
*.woff    binary
*.woff2   binary
*.ttf     binary
*.otf     binary
*.pdf     binary
